  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLogic:** Second number × 2 = (First number + Third number) **\n\n**(15, 22, 29)**\n\n→ 22 × 2 = (15 + 29)\n\n→ 44 = 44\n\nNow, let's check each option,\n\n1) **(21, 41, 49)**\n\n→ 41 × 2 = (21 + 49)\n\n→ 82 ≠ 70\n\n2) **(44, 67, 17)**\n\n→ 67 × 2 = (44 + 17)\n\n→ 134 ≠ 61\n\n3) **(17, 42, 38)**\n\n→ 42 × 2 = (17 + 38)\n\n→ 84 ≠ 55\n\n4) **(9, 13, 17)**\n\n→ 13 × 2 = (9 + 17)\n\n→ 26 = 26 ⇒ **Follows the logic.**\n\nHence, the correct answer is** \"(9, 13, 17)\"**.",
